  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The berserker can enter a state of calm. While in this stance, the berserker doesn't gain any benefits from rage other than the temporary hit points, but he doesn't take any of the penalties from rage (including the penalty to AC and the restriction on actions he can take). Rounds spent in a calm stance still count against his total number of rounds of rage per day. This is a stance rage power.</p>",
